## Original Content
Selon les médias américains CBS et Axios, le patron de la CIA, John Ratcliffe, est en visite mardi à Moscou. Une annonce que ni le gouvernement américain ni le Kremlin n'ont jusqu'ici officiellement confirmé.

## Summary
According to American media outlets CBS and Axios, CIA Director John Ratcliffe is reportedly visiting Moscow on Tuesday. However, this visit has not been officially confirmed by either the U.S. government or the Kremlin.

## Key Points
- CIA Director John Ratcliffe is reportedly visiting Moscow.
- The report originates from American media sources CBS and Axios.
- Neither the U.S. government nor the Kremlin have officially confirmed the visit.
- The visit is scheduled for Tuesday.


